---
title: "3. Registering interest in a placement"
---
flowchart TD
    S([Person opens<br/>'Register your interest']):::start --> A{Are they<br/>signed in?}:::question
    A -- No --> AX([Ask them to sign in<br/>or create an account first]):::stop
    A -- Yes --> B[Step 1: who they are<br/>and their school or college]:::step
    B --> B2{Are the answers valid?}:::question
    B2 -- No --> BX([Show what needs fixing]):::stop
    B2 -- Yes --> C[Step 2: routes,<br/>year group and consent]:::step
    C --> C2{Valid, and have they agreed<br/>to be contacted?}:::question
    C2 -- No --> CX([Show what needs fixing,<br/>or explain we need their permission]):::stop
    C2 -- Yes --> D[Step 3: show their answers<br/>so they can check them]:::step
    D --> E{Already registered<br/>interest before?}:::question
    E -- No --> F[Save their interest]:::step
    E -- Yes --> G[Replace their earlier answers<br/>instead of adding a duplicate]:::step
    F --> H[Tell the team in Slack]:::step
    G --> H
    H --> OK([Thank them: interest registered<br/>or details updated]):::good

    N["Routes: Digital, Business, Media,<br/>Finance or Engineering. They can<br/>remove their interest from their account."]:::note
    C -.- N

    classDef start fill:#232f3e,stroke:#232f3e,color:#ffffff,font-weight:bold
    classDef step fill:#ffffff,stroke:#232f3e,color:#0f1111
    classDef question fill:#fff0d6,stroke:#a35c00,color:#0f1111
    classDef good fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#1e7e34,color:#0f1111,font-weight:bold
    classDef stop fill:#fdecea,stroke:#b3261e,color:#0f1111
    classDef note fill:#f0f2f2,stroke:#6f7777,color:#0f1111,stroke-dasharray:4 3
